OL,3,A'You cannot build this car anywhere
OL,4,Aelse in the world'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British carmaker has unveiled plans
OL,7,Fto start production of its hand-built
OL,8,Felectric sports car in Warwickshire.
OL,10,FLongbow is to start production of its
OL,11,Flimited-edition Speedster at Mira Tech
OL,12,FPark in Nuneaton next year.
OL,14,FWest Midlands mayor Richard Parker, who
OL,15,Fbacked Longbow with #3m from a
OL,16,Fgovernment fund, said the project will
OL,17,Fbe followed by the firm's Roadster
OL,18,Fmodel, creating more than 200 skilled
OL,19,Fjobs.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
